    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-γονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμογενής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.146
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀπὸ μητρὸς αὐτῷ ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			 : as Subst., <i>kinsman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				878d
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὁ.</span>”
				<i>animals of the same kind, congeners,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					610b13
				</span></i>
			 : more generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αἰσθητὸν γένος τούτων ἑκάσταις ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					156b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>born at the same time with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[χρόνος τῷ παντί]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					387
				</span></i>
			.</div>
